{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04501","headline":"三月三日宴王明府山亭 · 陈子昂","name":"三月三日宴王明府山亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮春嘉月，上巳芳辰。\n羣公禊饮，于洛之滨。\n奕奕车骑，粲粲都人。\n连帷竞野，袨服缛津。\n青郊树密，翠渚萍新。\n今我不乐，含意□申。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04501.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04501","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}